## Status

- **Not compiled or run.** No tools were available, and the supplied source lacks `ExpressionId`, `LoanId`, `LoanPlan`, `Diagnostic`, `tests.rs`, and `deferred.rs`.
- **Borrow checker.** I reasoned about it but did not verify it. The plan is that `append_into` destructures `Storage` and `Scratch` into separate `&mut` locals. The `origin` closure only shares `*local`, and the two `storage.id` / `storage.live` calls become `contains` over the directory slices.
- **Test fixtures are placeholders.** `plan`, `program`, `with_ledger`, and the `Debug` bounds must be bound to your existing test infrastructure. I can't see it, so those are the unverified parts.
- **Assertions to treat as hypotheses.** `new.charged < old.charged` for equal-size plans follows from scratch being charged once instead of per plan. `ordinals == [1]` follows from the last local duplicate winning at base 0. Neither has been run.
- **No allocator-level `Drop` check.** The `Drop` control only pins "scratch empty at receiver drop".
